## CRITICAL RULES (always apply)

POM is NOT HTML. These will crash the compiler:
- FORBIDDEN TAGS: {{ forbidden_tags | join(', ') }}
- FORBIDDEN ATTRS: {{ forbidden_attributes | join(', ') }}
- Use <VStack>/<HStack> not <div>, <Text> not <p>, <Span> not <span>
- <Shape> is a LEAF — never nest children inside it. Use text= attribute for text.
- Tables MUST use <Col width="..."> for every column so cells don't collapse together.
  Column widths should sum to the usable slide width (1280 minus 2*root padding).
- Bullet lists: each bullet is a SEPARATE <Text> inside a <VStack gap="8">.
  Never concatenate multiple bullets into one <Text> element.

Colors: 6-digit hex, NO leading #. Use $token references from Theme.
  VALID: color="$textMain"  backgroundColor="FF0000"
  INVALID: color="#FF0000"  color="red"

Margin & Padding: single number OR dot notation. NOT CSS shorthand.
  VALID: margin="10"  margin.top="48" margin.left="40"
  INVALID: margin="48 0 0 40"  padding="10px"

Dimensions: always > 0. w="0" or h="0" crashes the renderer.

Enums: alignItems/justifyContent = start|center|end (NOT left/right)
       textAlign = left|center|right (NOT start/end)

